{"data": [{"author_id": "1305905708018348032", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:39:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120572235786150139"], "id": "2120572235786150139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 354, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国大陆央行将加大逆周期调节力度，社融与货币供应增速双双放缓\n\n中国大陆人民银行11月11日发布第三季度货币政策执行报告，重申继续实施适度宽松的货币政策，并表示将加大逆周期调节力度，扩大国内需求，支持经济增长。 https://t.co/Vz6LBpwogt", "url": "https://x.com/CausMoney/status/2120572235786150139"}, {"author_id": "1018462639658229760", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:07:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119944894458548568"], "id": "2119944894458548568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ほんとウチの会社融通がきかねぇわ。\n怪我して足が痛くて、出社する時に会社の駐車場を今週いっぱい使わせてくれないかって他の課の人が申し出た時た時、駐車場300台も置けるのに、すんなりOKが出せないのは何故なん", "url": "https://x.com/13ErtofWnZBgnDK/status/2119944894458548568"}, {"author_id": "1873024376834277377", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:08:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119975400218751417"], "id": "2119975400218751417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 45, "impression_count": 25583, "like_count": 148, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "我个人对熊市的定义是指数丧失创新高的能力，在发生了这么多真实的牛市反转性质的利空之后，包括但不限于Anthropic增长放缓、社融供给能力到达瓶颈、政治氛围与民意逆转、nvda陷入丑闻、牛市图形彻底走坏之后，你没有办法拍拍屁股从地上站起来装作什么都没发生，说those all r fake", "url": "https://x.com/Victory_1919/status/2119975400218751417"}, {"author_id": "1749597659902713856", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:09:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120474105183109292"], "id": "2120474105183109292", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 139, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国人民银行在2026年第三季度货币政策执行报告中提出，推动贷款利率定价基准从比较单一地参考LPR向更加多元基准转型，并指导金融机构探索发放挂钩DR001的浮动利率贷款。", "url": "https://x.com/bytelee_trade/status/2120474105183109292"}, {"author_id": "2073074194112237568", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:45:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120528287671922965"], "id": "2120528287671922965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MACRO &amp; REGULATORY WATCH 11NOV26\n\nThe People's Bank of China released its Q3 2026 Monetary Policy Execution Report, outlining plans to optimize the non-bank large redemption swap facility and shift toward diversified LPR pricing benchmarks. \n\nThe central bank also conducted RMB", "url": "https://x.com/VestigiaLabs/status/2120528287671922965"}, {"author_id": "1486571626661437440", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:53:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120484984389882022"], "id": "2120484984389882022", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1543, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120112199029108822", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "中美利率：利差3.4个点，人民币一年升值约5.8%\n\n美国在加息、长端收益率接近5%，中国长端收益率在1.6%附近；利差在拉大，人民币却在升值，央行的动作是往回拉。 https://t.co/fnvpmB0XWq https://t.co/sSLYGiPgt9", "url": "https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2120484984389882022"}, {"author_id": "10713142", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:01:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120471914070360299"], "id": "2120471914070360299", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "总体市场评分：4/10（方向性情绪：-3）\n\n主要偏多因素：\n- 花旗将CoreWeave目标价上调至149美元，AI数据中心基础设施需求持续强劲。\n- 德国30年期国债收益率回落至3.66%，全球债券收益率下降利好股市估值扩张。\n- Hapag-Lloyd大幅上调全年EBIT和EBITDA指引，航运业盈利超预期复苏。\n-", "url": "https://x.com/fwteam/status/2120471914070360299"}, {"author_id": "2057761293373743104", "created_at": "2026-11-10T11:12:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120112452696264809"], "id": "2120112452696264809", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 319, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【中国宏观与市场｜2026-11-10】\n\n结论：国内偏多，今晚美国CPI是关键变量。\n托底资金已经在真实买入，油价回落对成长股有利；海外市场已完全定价美联储12月加息，CPI若偏热，会先压美股AI链，再传导到A股光模块和算力龙头。今晚不因政策消息追高。\n\n1/", "url": "https://x.com/QiaoweiXulbto/status/2120112452696264809"}, {"author_id": "1888765489352212481", "created_at": "2026-11-11T07:54:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120424907062596034"], "id": "2120424907062596034", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 356, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "收盘了\n\n上证 +0.45%\n深成 +1.21%\n创业板 +2.98%\n\n光模块是最猛的\n新易盛 +16.6%\n中际旭创 +15.2%\n\n但今天我不想聊涨了多少\n我想聊明天开盘看什么\n\n先说一件事\n\n今天尾盘是回吐的\n沪指从 +0.51 回到 +0.45\n创业板从 +3.10 回到 +2.98\n\n回吐很小\n但它说明高位有人在卖\n\n明天开盘", "url": "https://x.com/X_key_He/status/2120424907062596034"}, {"author_id": "2047487856634187777", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:44:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120513105872716201"], "id": "2120513105872716201", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 674, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "傍晚重磅双消息落地！央行释放最新货币政策信号，市场底层逻辑彻底更新\n\n傍晚央行Q3货币执行报告连发两条关键重磅内容，瞬间牵动股、债、汇整体盘面，市场预期再度重塑！", "url": "https://x.com/ixyue29/status/2120513105872716201"}, {"author_id": "2029233769409024000", "created_at": "2026-11-10T11:15:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120112998387732768"], "id": "2120112998387732768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A UHF windshield tag reads at 10 to 30 feet at close to 100 percent, which is unbeatable for a fixed tenant fleet. It is also useless for a driver who showed up once and will never come back.\n\nhttps://t.co/H0DjrIAlaR\n\n#AccessControl #LPR", "url": "https://x.com/winsparking/status/2120112998387732768"}, {"author_id": "1467720846198329347", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:17:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120158